{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Galaxy Dreamer</strong> page - an old-school space shooter that will remind you of your childhood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: 2D Top down Shoot'em Up, where you control a spaceship and shoot opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Several game modes</strong>: Company, Arcade, Random Run, Boss Rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Company mode: story levels that can be completed separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arcade mode: story levels are sequential, and between them you can choose upgrades for your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Random Run: arcade levels with random opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenges: separate levels with unique game mechanics, boss battles and just additions to the main company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable content:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the ability to upgrade your ship;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 types of unique ships with special attacks;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more than a dozen unique weapons that will help you deal with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op</strong>: you can shoot opponents together with a friend or friends (up to 4 people)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong>: separate levels with unique game mechanics, boss battles and just additions to the main company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of <strong>different opponents</strong> that will create problems for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses</strong>, each of whom is ready to show you what pain is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Several dozen cool soundtracks</strong> that will not let you get bored during the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Captain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/27414a18f27f49937a05fc5c26f29b29aa154b59.jpg"},{"name":"Cadet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/b9a82cec98ec8ee6bc13644a776e1a6666f3155e.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/3d7122d581811c6adba887476bfc55aa7060e5ba.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/a11f507e9269c61b51e54b0c2b69024198f55d98.jpg"},{"name":"Score Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/9271c75467d0378fc228af0394e6a6c657d75189.jpg"},{"name":"Arcade player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/69b84e115333a22602a73356b6273405caf4bf64.jpg"},{"name":"Boss destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/a60206aa7291bfa09cb62df38253845c92494e3c.jpg"},{"name":"Allies to battle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/1e87a32555d82b995d4ae9706b2599b02e57fd8a.jpg"},{"name":"This is power!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/07a18255c7c910d9a4621fe9122842edbf964028.jpg"},{"name":"Fast and the Furious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2842910/2de45605e74b4db4dff2fefc5752946e0673246b.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2842910?t=1761295196","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2842910?t=1761295196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842910/b2a3ec10cbe101fc66471d